  "name": "noosphere",
  "description": "Noosphere is a decentralized, content-addressable protocol designed for collaborative thought and knowledge sharing using a planetary consciousness model. It leverages IPLD-based data structures, UCAN-based authorization, and a custom DHT-driven name system to enable secure, versioned synchronization across diverse platforms. The system provides high-performance Rust core primitives with FFI bindings for Swift, C, and WebAssembly, facilitating peer-to-peer replication and semantic transclusion.",
